{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_068_1000_021mat", "source_sha256": "e411c16c496a79312d7f25087d7f0f0a9fd7e5018a4777bf4616fd63e9686511", "ja": "今度TVのお仕事で、春香ちゃんが\n作文を読むと聞いたのです。\n姫は興味津々なのです！", "zh": "听说下次的电视工作中，春香要朗读作文。\n本公主对此可是充满兴趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_068_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "dc4047525f32362f86cc983eb0608e0e31c1655998d27972558fe396271c2b3c", "ja": "そうそう、小学校の時に書いた\n『将来の夢』の作文なんだっ。\nえへへ、なんだか恥ずかしいよね。", "zh": "对对，是我小学时写的《未来的梦想》作文。\n嘿嘿，总觉得有点不好意思呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_068_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "595ac6afe72b51922e9501b1c4cff536d725ed94c5d4a58e49acdb60f60cacb3", "ja": "でも、確かに気になりますね～。\n小学生の春香さんは、\nどんな夢を見ていたんでしょう？", "zh": "不过，确实让人在意呢～  \n小学时的春香小姐，  \n究竟怀揣着怎样的梦想呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_068_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "80df0e50b0bb3c580558d26c168039f38ce44d8fb89e98e01e32d21c43e38c03", "ja": "あはは、けっこう普通の夢だよ？\n自分でも気になって、さっき\n読み直してみたんだけど～。", "zh": "啊哈哈，其实挺普通的哦？\n我自己也很好奇，刚才\n还重读了一遍呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_068_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "12e14ea3955fa4050a1ec8b98e349c16c8fb1541c1e08eb9c4b34d51bc331654", "ja": "ほ？　春香ちゃん、\nもしかして今、\n持っているのです？", "zh": "咦？春香，你现在该不会正拿着吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_068_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "6dc39883584d9a8c1fd1df3a255226480f3bbf0c67ea12e324fe903cde635200", "ja": "まあ。それは楽しみですね～♪", "zh": "哎呀。真让人期待呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_068_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "cf9bc6c5aa8274a785bdb442a2ca31b9f2be39980a6f36e4bfc9cc4049a471ea", "ja": "え？　えっと……、あれ？", "zh": "诶？那个……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
